## Dependencies
- Phase 1 → Phase 2 → Phase 3 (sequential within each feature group)
- Phase 2,3 → Phase 4,5 → Phase 6,7 → Phase 8,9 (feature groups in order)
- Phase 10 requires all prior phases complete

